      "index": "b3d",
      "text": "This repair can't be undone. If it doesn't work: Nightshift records\nit, keeps watching and asks again before any other repair that is\nnot ticked as safe. If it makes things worse: Nightshift stops\nautomatic repairs on this cluster and calls a person.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This repair can't be undone. If it doesn't work: Nightshift records\nit, keeps watching and asks again before any other repair that is\nnot ticked as safe. If it makes things worse: Nightshift stops\nautomatic repairs on this cluster and calls a person.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
