      "index": "b86",
      "text": "Result = final repair status, mapped to FR-34 outcomes: Succeeded (worked)\n· Failed (did not work and undone / did not work and could not be undone /\nfailed / recovery failed / harmful) · Blocked · Cancelled · Expired ·\nRejected by <name> · Manual repair reported done. Who permitted it: ticked\n· agreed management policy (version) · approved at the time (by whom,\nwhen, on behalf of) · last-resort condition.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Result = final repair status, mapped to FR-34 outcomes: Succeeded (worked)\n· Failed (did not work and undone / did not work and could not be undone /\nfailed / recovery failed / harmful) · Blocked · Cancelled · Expired ·\nRejected by <name> · Manual repair reported done. Who permitted it: ticked\n· agreed management policy (version) · approved at the time (by whom,\nwhen, on behalf of) · last-resort condition.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
